Package: com.snowgears.shop.test.listener. Test listener docstrings.

[_summary]
Listener tests for the Shop plugin. Unit-tests build-limit calculation logic using Mockito for Bukkit/Spigot type mocking.

[_conclusions]
Listener tests validate numeric build-limit results without requiring full server mocking.

[_does]
Unit-tests build-limit calculation logic in ShopListener using Mockito-inline for mocking final PermissionAttachmentInfo class.

